{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"acbe77fbda04756f7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 SA 之外的物理启发优化算法：gravity / crystallization / fluid / swarm / electromagnetic 等。\n\n**背景：** SA 是物理启发最经典案例，但 2024-2026 还有别的物理隐喻。这一类算法常被忽视，但可能对 placement 有特殊适配性。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. Gravitational Search Algorithm (GSA)\n2. Crystallization heuristics\n3. Particle Swarm / Ant Colony 现状\n4. Fluid dynamics / lattice Boltzmann\n5. Electromagnetism-like algorithms\n6. 哪些在 packing 上有实证\n\n输出末尾：\"是否任何一个值得借用\""},"uuid":"efa22a68-698a-4a2f-9a1b-6bfeffdcc323","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:16.507Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
