{"parentUuid":"de751f42-1d0a-47c4-ba1d-d0a279895f1a","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"acbe77fbda04756f7","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_013KXHLn6xuL7TDW2aAk7GLK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014dKgwN7DhAh7CWLvCkkCcC","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"\"physics-inspired\" metaheuristic packing benchmark comparison simulated annealing 2025"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1464,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4762,"cache_read_input_tokens":20305,"output_tokens":238,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4762},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1464,"output_tokens":238,"cache_read_input_tokens":20305,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4762,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4762,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaoySgrnBN3hppM5nZWWh","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"8552d7a5-e964-425e-a81f-d4a6e54d56ac","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:38.135Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"de751f42-1d0a-47c4-ba1d-d0a279895f1a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"acbe77fbda04756f7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Huri1AEMy6TNxe8L9rg9o","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"lattice Boltzmann fluid dynamics combinatorial optimization placement 2024\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"SOLUTION TO INDUSTRY BENCHMARK PROBLEMS ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.3ds.com/assets/invest/2024-02/solution_to_industry_benchmark_problems_with_the_lattice-boltzmann_code_xflow_01.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Combining Lattice Boltzmann method and genetic algorithm to optimize the layout of artificial floating islands in river network in China | Environmental Science and Pollution Research | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11356-022-23785-0\"},{\"title\":\"Optimization of single node load balancing for lattice Boltzmann method on heterogeneous high performance computers - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0743731525001364\"},{\"title\":\"Quantum lattice Boltzmann method for simulating nonlinear ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41534-025-01142-6_reference.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"The Lattice Boltzmann Method (LBM) in CFD | SimWiki | SimScale\",\"url\":\"https://www.simscale.com/docs/simwiki/cfd-computational-fluid-dynamics/lattice-boltzmann-method-lbm/\"},{\"title\":\"Lattice Boltzmann methods - Wikipedia\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lattice_Boltzmann_methods\"},{\"title\":\"Parallel Optimization for Coupled Lattice Boltzmann-Finite Volume Method on Heterogeneous Many-Core Supercomputer\",\"url\":\"https://www.mdpi.com/2076-3417/16/2/721\"},{\"title\":\"Topology optimization using the lattice Boltzmann method for unsteady natural convection problems | Structural and Multidisciplinary Optimization | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00158-023-03522-y\"},{\"title\":\"Lattice Boltzmann model for non-ideal compressible fluid ...\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.14712\"},{\"title\":\"Performance Analysis of the Lattice Boltzmann Model Beyond Navier-Stokes\",\"url\":\"https://dash.harvard.edu/entities/publication/73120378-afc1-6bd4-e053-0100007fdf3b\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found several relevant topics related to lattice Boltzmann methods, fluid dynamics, and optimization:\n\n## Key Findings\n\n**Load Balancing and Hardware Placement Optimization (2024-2025):**\n\nA novel load balancing strategy based on a genetic algorithm has been proposed for bottom-up, cost-aware optimization of spatial domain decompositions in lattice Boltzmann methods, which generates subdomains and rank assignments suited for cooperative execution on both CPUs and GPUs. Implementation in the OpenLB framework achieved speedups of up to 87% compared to traditional GPU-only execution.\n\n**Processor Layout Strategy (2024):**\n\nA processor layout strategy was designed to address load imbalance and communication redundancy in coupled lattice Boltzmann-finite volume method solvers, along with parallelization techniques including LBM restructuring, data reuse, and SIMD optimization.\n\n**Combinatorial Optimization for Floating Island Placement (2022):**\n\nThe Lattice Boltzmann method has been used to simulate the law of hydrodynamics and pollutant transport in river networks, combined with genetic algorithms to optimize the layout of artificial floating islands.\n\nThe search results show active research in 2024-2025 on combining lattice Boltzmann methods with optimization techniques (particularly genetic algorithms) for hardware placement and domain decomposition strategies in computational fluid dynamics simulations.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"1ac7f01a-41d0-4a90-a857-915bf9370e75","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:44.341Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"de751f42-1d0a-47c4-ba1d-d0a279895f1a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"d598295b-e8bd-414d-9004-4278fcf3d6a7","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"acbe77fbda04756f7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016P9oD4zTVr6AZ6imeywtsZ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"ant colony optimization 2D bin packing layout 2025 state of art\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Building Hyper-heuristics Through Ant Colony Optimization for the 2D Bin Packing Problem | SpringerLink\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/11554028_91\"},{\"title\":\"Study on improved ant colony optimization for bin-packing problem | IEEE Conference Publication | IEEE Xplore\",\"url\":\"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/iel5/5520349/5540686/05540875.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) Building Hyper-heuristics Through Ant Colony Optimization for the 2D Bin Packing Problem\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/221021216_Building_Hyper-heuristics_Through_Ant_Colony_Optimization_for_the_2D_Bin_Packing_Problem\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) An Efficient Ant Colony Optimization for Two-dimensional Bin Packing Problem with Defect Issue\",\"url\":\"https://www.academia.edu/14303602/An_Efficient_Ant_Colony_Optimization_for_Two_dimensional_Bin_Packing_Problem_with_Defect_Issue\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) An Ant Colony Optimization Heuristic for Solving the Two-Dimensional Level Packing Problems\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/323759711_An_Ant_Colony_Optimization_Heuristic_for_Solving_the_Two-Dimensional_Level_Packing_Problems\"},{\"title\":\"An Efficient Ant Colony Optimization for Two-dimensional Bin Packing Problem with Defect Issue | Semantic Scholar\",\"url\":\"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/An-Efficient-Ant-Colony-Optimization-for-Bin-with-Lu-Wan/814e0cd274c5352d7ccfc32c15a39074349022fa\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) A NOVEL WORK FOR BIN PACKING PROBLEM BY ANT COLONY OPTIMIZATION\",\"url\":\"https://www.academia.edu/7710569/A_NOVEL_WORK_FOR_BIN_PACKING_PROBLEM_BY_ANT_COLONY_OPTIMIZATION\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) Ant colony optimization and local search for bin packing and cutting stock problems\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/245423006_Ant_colony_optimization_and_local_search_for_bin_packing_and_cutting_stock_problems\"},{\"title\":\"Ant Colony Optimisation and Local Search for Bin Packing ...\",\"url\":\"https://strathprints.strath.ac.uk/4823/6/strathprints004823.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - MonetSlinowsky/ants-packing-bins: An implementation of Ant Colony Optimization for the bin packing problem\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/MonetSlinowsky/ants-packing-bins\"}]\n\nBased on the web search results, here's what I found regarding ant colony optimization for 2D bin packing and layout in 2025:\n\n## Recent Developments (2025)\n\nAnt colony optimization (ACO) integrates with the flawless corner space placement (FCSP) algorithm to enhance packing efficiency. One recent advancement involves addressing practical industrial challenges—specifically, in actual settings, stock sheets inevitably contain some defects, and manufacturers have to avoid cutting products which contain the defects in industries like TFT-LCD and e-paper production.\n\n## State of the Art Approaches\n\nA recent approach integrates ant colony optimization with the flawless corner space placement algorithm to solve 2D bin packing problems with defects (2DBPPWD). Numerical experiments demonstrate ACO-FCSP's superior performance compared to genetic algorithm-based approaches in packing without defects, with the C21 and N13 problems serving as benchmarks and highlighting significant improvements in packing outcomes.\n\n## Hybrid Methods\n\nThe current trend in research emphasizes hybrid approaches. A hybrid ant colony algorithm coupled with a simple local search algorithm solves two-dimensional bin packing and strip packing problems with additional constraints. Hybrid ACO approaches can outperform the best-known hybrid evolutionary solution methods for certain problem classes.\n\n## Performance Advantages\n\nResults showed that the ACO algorithm combined with the candidate list was more robust and consistently outperformed genetic algorithm (GA), CPLEX, and other heuristics, especially for large job instances.\n\nThe research suggests that ACO remains a competitive approach for 2D bin packing, particularly when combined with local search strategies and adapted for real-world constraints like defect avoidance.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"80c9c351-18ab-4c47-abf3-a08065cb2270","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:44.822Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d598295b-e8bd-414d-9004-4278fcf3d6a7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"8552d7a5-e964-425e-a81f-d4a6e54d56ac","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408","agentId":"acbe77fbda04756f7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014dKgwN7DhAh7CWLvCkkCcC","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"physics-inspired\" metaheuristic packing benchmark comparison simulated annealing 2025\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Improved metaheuristics for the two-dimensional strip packing problem - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1568494620302088\"},{\"title\":\"A Review of Classic Metaheuristic Optimization Algorithms | Proceedings of the 2025 6th International Conference on Computer Information and Big Data Applications\",\"url\":\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/full/10.1145/3746709.3746761\"},{\"title\":\"Applications, classifications, and challenges: a comprehensive evaluation of recently developed metaheuristics for search and analysis | Artificial Intelligence Review | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10462-025-11377-6\"},{\"title\":\"Recent metaheuristic algorithms for solving some civil engineering optimization problems | Scientific Reports\",\"url\":\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-025-90000-8\"},{\"title\":\"A hybrid simulated annealing metaheuristic algorithm for the two-dimensional knapsack packing problem | Request PDF\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/235328696_A_hybrid_simulated_annealing_metaheuristic_algorithm_for_the_two-dimensional_knapsack_packing_problem\"},{\"title\":\"Recent metaheuristic algorithms for solving some civil engineering optimization problems - PMC\",\"url\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11885586/\"},{\"title\":\"algorithm simulated annealing: Topics by Science.gov\",\"url\":\"https://www.science.gov/topicpages/a/algorithm+simulated+annealing\"},{\"title\":\"Metaheuristic Optimization for Automatic Arrangement of ...\",\"url\":\"https://dspace.mit.edu/bitstream/handle/1721.1/162904/lohier-slohier-meng-eecs-2025-thesis.pdf?sequence=1&isAllowed=y\"},{\"title\":\"Simulated Annealing | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-032-00044-6_11\"},{\"title\":\"A hybrid simulated annealing metaheuristic algorithm for the two-dimensional knapsack packing problem | Computers and Operations Research\",\"url\":\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1016/j.cor.2010.10.022\"}]\n\nI've completed the web search for your query on physics-inspired metaheuristic packing benchmark comparisons involving simulated annealing for 2025. Here's a summary of the results:\n\n## Key Findings:\n\n**Physics-Based Metaheuristics Classification:**\nPhysics-based metaheuristics take inspiration from the physical sciences to develop optimization algorithms, with examples including simulated annealing, gravitational search algorithm, and charge system search.\n\n**Simulated Annealing in Packing Problems:**\nApproaches involving the method of simulated annealing yield favorable results for strip packing problems. The SPSAL algorithm involves an application of the method of simulated annealing to solve SPP instances directly in the space of completely defined packing layouts.\n\n**2025 Research on Metaheuristics:**\nA comprehensive study analyzes 162 metaheuristic algorithms through a unified multi-criteria taxonomy, with bibliometric assessment of publications from 2000 to 2024. Additionally, a novel hybrid metaheuristic algorithm (BES–GO) was proposed for solving benchmark structural design optimization problems and compared with ten state-of-the-art algorithms including various optimization techniques.\n\n**Hybrid Approaches:**\nRecent work leverages a hybrid approach combining Genetic Algorithms and Simulated Annealing for bin-packing problems, showing the continued relevance of SA in modern optimization frameworks.\n\nThe search results indicate active research in 2025 on metaheuristic comparisons and packing problems, with simulated annealing remaining a competitive approach, often used in hybrid configurations.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"50c10bf3-3e5c-450e-ada1-e8b4d4bed842","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:10:45.513Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8552d7a5-e964-425e-a81f-d4a6e54d56ac","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"50c10bf3-3e5c-450e-ada1-e8b4d4bed842","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"acbe77fbda04756f7","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01AYKq5mwD9Ns2Gvni5qCc8P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已经有足够材料来写报告。下面是调研结果。\n\n---\n\n# 物理启发优化算法调研（SA 之外）\n\n## 1. Gravitational Search Algorithm (GSA)\n2024-2025 GSA 仍在活跃改进，但**几乎全在连续优化领域**：MAR-GSA 加入吸引-排斥混合、Manifold-Guided GSA 处理高维、Quantum-GSA 用于云数据放置。**没找到 GSA 应用在 2D 矩形 packing/网格 placement 的实证论文**。GSA 把候选解当作\"质量体\"，靠万有引力互相牵引——这套语义和离散网格 placement 适配性差，需要把整数解嵌进连续空间再投影回去，实践中通常被 SA/GA 吊打。已知缺点：易陷局部最优、收敛慢，2025 年的工作主要在补这两个洞。\n\n## 2. Crystallization Heuristics\n**搜不到\"crystallization\"作为命名算法在 packing 上的最新工作**。比较接近的是 2025 年 1 月 MDPI 那篇\"soft rotated rectangles\"——允许矩形软变形挤进容器，思路有点像晶体生长但本质是几何 NLP。这个隐喻在文献里基本没形成算法学派，更多是 SA 退火的别名。\n\n## 3. PSO / ACO 现状\n**PSO**：2D 不规则 strip packing 上有持续工作，比如 Sequence Transfer-PSO、Layout Pattern PSO、2025 年的 Fidelity-Adaptive Evolutionary Optimization。**典型套路是 PSO 只优化\"放置顺序\"，几何放置交给 BL/MaxRects 这类构造启发式**——PSO 本身管不了离散网格冲突。在 31 个标准 benchmark 上，SwarmNest 仅 10/31 达到或超过最优，说明纯 PSO 不强。\n\n**ACO**：2025 年有 ACO + Flawless Corner Space Placement (FCSP) 解带缺陷的 2D bin packing，号称比 GA 强；也有 ACO + 局部搜索的 hybrid。ACO 的优势在\"序列决策\"——决定下一个放哪——和 placement 顺序问题天然契合。但仍是 hybrid 才有竞争力。\n\n## 4. Fluid Dynamics / Lattice Boltzmann\nLBM 本身是 PDE 求解器，**2024-2025 在组合优化上几乎没作为搜索算法的应用**，仅有的 2022 工作是用 LBM 模拟水流物理 + GA 优化漂浮岛位置——LBM 是评估器不是优化器。LBM 在 packing 上没有可借鉴路径。\n\n## 5. Electromagnetism-like (EM) Algorithm\nEM 用\"带电粒子吸引-排斥\"机制移动样本点，**有 facility layout 实证**：reconfigurable manufacturing system 布局、动态 inter/intra cell 布局、供应链选址（EM+SA hybrid）。2025 年还有新出的 Electromagnetic Wave Propagation Algorithm (EMWPA)。**EM 比 GSA 更接近 placement 语义**——\"同性相斥\"天然对应\"两个 facility 不能挤一起\"。但论文里的 facility layout 都是\"块在车间里浮动连续坐标\"，不是 70x70 离散网格的硬约束 packing。\n\n## 6. Packing 实证排序\n按\"在 packing 上有真实战绩\"排：\n1. **GA / SA hybrid**（基线，被新算法当对照）\n2. **PSO + BL/MaxRects**（序列优化层有用）\n3. **ACO + 局部搜索**（序列优化层有用，2D bin packing 多次胜过 GA）\n4. **EM-like**（layout 有论文，但都是连续坐标）\n5. GSA / Crystallization / LBM：**packing 上无实证或非优化器角色**\n\n---\n\n## 是否任何一个值得借用\n\n**基本都不值得直接搬。** 当前求解器是 OR-Tools CP-SAT + Benders 的精确路线，目标是 `max_lex(area, min_side)` 的**证明级**最优；上面这些算法全是启发式，没法给 certified bound。\n\n唯一可能在 **AI sidecar (Lane C, order_only)** 借鉴的是 **ACO 的信息素机制**——给\"候选 placement 顺序\"打分时，ACO 的 pheromone trail 比简单贪心更能跨 wave 累积\"哪些候选放前面好\"的经验，跟 Phase 3B 的 candidate ordering 任务匹配。但这只是当 ordering 模型的归纳偏置，**不能碰 checkpoint、不能改 proof**，受 AI Safety Contract 严格约束。\n\nEM-like 的\"排斥\"思路在概念上有点意思（互相干扰的 facility 应该被推开），但 CP-SAT 的 NoOverlap 已经是硬约束、效率比 EM 的软排斥高一个量级，没必要绕路。\n\nGSA / crystallization / LBM **不建议借用**。\n\nSources:\n- [MAR-GSA: Mixed attraction and repulsion based GSA (2024)](https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1016/j.ins.2024.120250)\n- [Manifold-Guided GSA (Wiley 2024)](https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1155/2024/5806437)\n- [Multi-strategy collaborative GSA (Nature SR 2025)](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-025-13215-9)\n- [Soft rotated rectangle packing (MDPI 2025)](https://www.mdpi.com/2227-7390/13/3/493)\n- [Neural-driven constructive heuristic for 2D bin packing (MDPI 2025)](https://www.mdpi.com/2079-9292/14/10/1956)\n- [Transformer-based placement heuristic for 2D strip packing (2025)](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0360835225006102)\n- [Sequence Transfer PSO for irregular packing](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9543656/)\n- [Fidelity-adaptive evolutionary optimization for 2D packing (Springer 2025)](https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10845-024-02329-y)\n- [Revised EM-like mechanism for RMS layout](https://www.researchgate.net/publication/257177459_A_revised_electromagnetism-like_mechanism_for_layout_design_of_reconfigurable_manufacturing_system)\n- [Electromagnetic Wave Propagation Algorithm (2025)](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2090447925003569)\n- [LBM + GA for floating island layout](https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11356-022-23785-0)\n- [Review of classic metaheuristics (ACM 2025)](https://dl.acm.org/doi/full/10.1145/3746709.3746761)\n- [Comprehensive eval of recent metaheuristics (Springer 2025)](https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10462-025-11377-6)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6311,"cache_read_input_tokens":25067,"output_tokens":2513,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6311},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2513,"cache_read_input_tokens":25067,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6311,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaoyTXgAVyDhNMHEqCS2y","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"f0d00e6d-0eef-4719-b317-f72f5aeff174","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:11:35.718Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
